<title>PORTUGAL: RESEARCH ALERT - Banco Comercial Portugues upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Banco Comercial Portugues upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers revised its rating of Banco Comercial Portugues in its July report to strong buy from buy, an official at the investment bank said.</p>
<p>But the official declined to give any price target. Salomon had forecast a price of 3,900 escudos over the next 12 months for Portugal's largest private sector bank in recommending a buy in its last report in June.</p>
<p>Shares in BCP gained 30 escudos at 3,440 on Thursday.</p>
<p>($1=181 escudos)</p>
<p>---Lisbon bureau 3511-3113125</p>
